evel up choices."]},{"k":"p","c":["Hector can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Hector.png","w":120,"h":113,"c":["Hector's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Hector.gif","w":120,"h":111,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["His unlocking spell, \"deckbrush\" is a reference to the weakest spear weapon in Curse of Darkness that serves as a joke weapon."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Hector","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Hector"}," at the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}